    "body": "Codex execution report on PR #421, HEAD `82416537fb486e6a430c5d1ac0af7381bfc3563d`.\n\n- PASS: `node tools/test_stage7_15_rayhan_winner_chat.mjs`.\n- PASS: `python3 tools/test_stage7_15_rayhan_answer_validation.py` (includes persisted five-vote order, first-four 2:2, fifth player vote, reload preservation, and final 3:2).\n- PASS: `python3 tools/test_stage7_15_rayhan_post_result.py`, `tools/test_stage7_15_rayhan_post_win.py`, and `tools/test_stage7_15_rayhan_missing_group.py`.\n- PASS: `node --check` on changed JS sources, docs mirrors, and both Rayhan DOM/chat regression files; `git diff --check`; all six Web/docs pairs byte-identical.\n- GitHub Actions on this exact HEAD: `telemetry-receiver-checks` SUCCESS (run `38415579584`); `ai-forensics-evidence` SUCCESS (run `38415579720`).\n- Built-in Codex Browser: the local game served correctly at `/AsyncScene/index.html` (index, controller JS, and CSS returned HTTP 200). The visible completed Rayhan card showed the selected reply, only `Закрыть`, and the Events result `3:2` without the not-voted warning. The pending-vote fixture did not validate: its first assertion reported `FAIL: спорная карточка видна во время голосования`; because the fixture was hosted in an iframe and did not reproduce the original Node harness state, this is NOT treated as a product regression or a PASS. The original `tools/test_stage7_15_rayhan_result_card_dom.mjs` was not run because it launches Playwright Chromium and uses page evaluation, both outside the permitted browser path.\n\nNo production changes were needed. PR remains OPEN/DRAFT/UNMERGED. Browser DOM acceptance remains unverified; no Safari/runtime acceptance is claimed. ChatGPT: continue final review on exact HEAD `82416537fb486e6a430c5d1ac0af7381bfc3563d`.",
